{"data":{"body":"**P2 \u2014 Preserve the existing invocation-end ordering contract.** Existing configuration documented all plugin hooks as registration-ordered, so reversing every end hook can break plugins whose flushing or cleanup depends on that order. Retain registration order, or introduce an explicit opt-in LIFO scope mechanism instead of changing existing plugin lists globally.","comment_node_id":"PRRC_kwDOQwbyFc772zUo","finding_digest":"228b02e451d041f1350baeb06c1087e868a78673c95bfbe462221502988bf67c","finding_id":"arf_v1_ekfqfzcr2ba7cnilv2ygyeeh5b","finding_key":"sdk/plugin/pluginrunner::oninvocationend::registration-order-compatibility","identity_key":"sdk/plugin/pluginrunner::oninvocationend::registration-order-compatibility","line":110,"observation_digest":"39e2f0167b6aee5395dc07ea8e5c9cb23b065293e2ce94f51722f2613e06990c","observation_id":"aro_v1_hhrpaft3nlxfhfo4a7vi4xe4wi","path":"sdk/src/main/java/software/amazon/lambda/durable/plugin/PluginRunner.java","prior_finding_id":"arf_v1_ekfqfzcr2ba7cnilv2ygyeeh5b","published_at":"2026-10-09T00:19:33Z","review_id":"arr_v1_uced5uhiw626ix4hlrvxazqc34","reviewed_base_sha":"0c8618e42d3b16e9b7115ab943a93253c0fe936c","reviewed_head_sha":"96356e4841da0c2c7d1ca380207d616d4c74239d","reviewer":"codex","start_line":110,"suggestion_id":""},"pull_request":{"number":769},"record_id":"art_v1_h3pyfgu7c22tuhgn5k2kzquwdi","record_type":"finding_observed","recorded_at":"2026-10-09T00:19:33Z","repository":{"full_name":"aws/aws-durable-execution-sdk-java","id":1124528661},"schema_version":1}
